LightWAM-AD
===========

This repository is an independent research implementation derived from the
open-source SimWAM codebase and informed by Light-WAM and Fast-WAM.

Upstream projects:

- SimWAM: https://github.com/H-EmbodVis/SimWAM
- Light-WAM: https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.08242
- Fast-WAM: https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.16666

The repository retains the MIT license and copyright notice from SimWAM.
Code or assets carried from other projects remain subject to their original
notices and licenses.  LightWAM-AD changes include the direct representation-
to-trajectory architecture, slot-preserving fusion head, Wan2.1-1.3B loader,
native-latent future supervision path, NAVSIM alignment checks, configurations,
tests, and documentation.
